      "value": "Agreed, old similar request from a year ago here: https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/automatically-hide-nsfw-avatars-marked-with-content-warning\nThere's a difference between nudity and NSFW so there should be separate options for those. \nAnd the avatar upload flags definitely need to get toggles added in the safety settings options.\nWould also recommend a flagging/reporting system that triggers avatars to get flagged as NSFW if reported enough to support the safety settings option. (instead of just leading to a ban assuming not just flat out nudity)",
